@startuml import-activity
' Simplified UML activity diagram of `beet import` (version 2.14.1).
' Notation follows Lecture 6: actions, swimlanes, decision/merge, fork/join.
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title Import pipeline for one album

|Importer|
start
:Read files into Items
and create an ImportTask;
if () then ([autotag off])
  :Import as-is;
else ([autotag on])
  |Autotag + providers|
  fork
    :Query MusicBrainz;
  fork again
    :Query other providers;
  end fork
  :Rank candidates
  into a Proposal;
  |Importer|
  :User chooses a match;
endif
if () then ([skip])
else ([apply or as-is])
  :Apply chosen metadata
  (none for as-is);
  |Library|
  :Add Album and Items
  to the database;
  |Plugins|
  :Run plugin
  import stages;
  |Importer|
  :Move or copy files
  and write tags;
endif
:Finalize: save progress,
notify plugins;
stop
@enduml
